messages.content:
Haan bilkul! Yahan main **2 Student Tables** ka complete Code de raha hoon with a clean, modern HTML & CSS design.

Isme:
1. **Table 1:** Student Personal Details (Roll No, Name, Class, Attendance)
2. **Table 2:** Student Academic Marks (Roll No, Name, Subject, Marks, Status)

### HTML & CSS Code:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Student Data Tables</title>
    <style>
        /* Base Reset & Styling */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f4f7fe;
            color: #333;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h2 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .table-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            overflow-x: auto; /* Responsive scrolling on smaller screens */
        }

        /* Table Styling */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #4f46e5;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        th:first-child {
            border-top-left-radius: 8px;
        }

        th:last-child {
            border-top-right-radius: 8px;
        }

        tr:hover {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }

        /* Status Badges */
        .badge {
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .badge-success {
            background-color: #d1fae5;
            color: #065f46;
        }

        .badge-warning {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            color: #92400e;
        }

        .badge-danger {
            background-color: #fee2e2;
            color: #991b1b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- TABLE 1: Student General Info -->
        <div class="table-card">
            <h2>1. Student Info Table</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Roll No</th>
                        <th>Name</th>
                        <th>Class</th>
                        <th>Email</th>
                        <th>Attendance</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>101</td>
                        <td>Aarav Sharma</td>
                        <td>Class 10-A</td>
                        <td>aarav@example.com</td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">92%</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>102</td>
                        <td>Riya Verma</td>
                        <td>Class 10-A</td>
                        <td>riya@example.com</td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">88%</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>103</td>
                        <td>Kunal Patel</td>
                        <td>Class 10-B</td>
                        <td>kunal@example.com</td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-warning">71%</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>104</td>
                        <td>Ananya Singh</td>
                        <td>Class 10-B</td>
                        <td>ananya@example.com</td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-danger">55%</span></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- TABLE 2: Student Marks & Status -->
        <div class="table-card">
            <h2>2. Student Performance / Marks Table</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Roll No</th>
                        <th>Student Name</th>
                        <th>Subject</th>
                        <th>Marks Secured</th>
                        <th>Status</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>101</td>
                        <td>Aarav Sharma</td>
                        <td>Mathematics</td>
                        <td>95 / 100</td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">Pass</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>102</td>
                        <td>Riya Verma</td>
                        <td>Science</td>
                        <td>82 / 100</td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">Pass</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>103</td>
                        <td>Kunal Patel</td>
                        <td>English</td>
                        <td>64 / 100</td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-success">Pass</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>104</td>
                        <td>Ananya Singh</td>
                        <td>Mathematics</td>
                        <td>28 / 100</td>
                        <td><span class="badge badge-danger">Fail</span></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
```

### Is Code Ke Key Features:
1. **Modern UI**: Dark indigo header, rounded card style background, and subtle hover effects.
2. **Responsive Wrapper**: Card ke andar `overflow-x: auto` diya hai taaki mobile screens par horizontal scroll chal sake.
3. **Badges**: Status/Attendance highlight karne ke liye color-coded badges (`Pass/Fail`, `Attendance %`).

Is code ko save karke `.html` file me chalao. Aur agar isme **FastAPI** backend se dynamic data render karna hai (Jinja2 Templates ke zariye) ya koi CSS customization chahiye, toh batao! 🚀
